[$media/ee23a45/mosquito-elephant-200x180.jpg [align right]]

A mosquito flied into the inner space of huge ear of elephant, then the elephant fanned its ear un-controlledly, he was noisy by the mosquito. The mosquito was flying here and there, circlying in the ear's huge space. The mosquito landed on the thick and back-light flesh of the ear, it decided to bite here abundantly, and suck up all the blood. When a housefly flies into this ear space, the elephant head shakes sharply.

